label "Augmented LLM diagram"
box in 16 104 70 40 "input"
box llm 150 92 120 64 "LLM|uses them" acc
box out 340 104 100 40 "output"
box ret 30 190 110 36 "retrieval"
box tools 175 190 110 36 "tools"
box mem 320 190 110 36 "memory"
arrow in llm
arrow llm out
arrow llm ret both
arrow llm tools both
arrow llm mem both
note "retrieval, tools and memory around one model: the building block of agents"
